{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Roots","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Order.IntermediateValue","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_character_D","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_character_D","kind":"theorem","line":339,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L339-L347","doc":"**Branch 1 is closed for convention D** — the canonical one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_character_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_character_C","kind":"theorem","line":333,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L333-L337","doc":"**Branch 1 is closed for convention C.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaD_neg_surjective_nonpos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaD_neg_surjective_nonpos","kind":"theorem","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L303-L322","doc":"Convention D attains every non-positive phase on `[1,∞)` **after negation**\n— `α_D` is unbounded above, and `cos` is even, so `−α_D` is the relevant\nfunction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaC_surjective_nonpos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaC_surjective_nonpos","kind":"theorem","line":294,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L294-L301","doc":"Convention C attains every non-positive phase on `[1,∞)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.surjective_nonpos_of_growth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.surjective_nonpos_of_growth","kind":"theorem","line":277,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L277-L290","doc":"**IVT packaging.**  A continuous phase vanishing at `s = 1` and taking\narbitrarily negative values on `[1,∞)` attains *every* non-positive real. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf_one","kind":"theorem","line":272,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L272-L275","doc":"`α_z(1) = 0` for any `z` — the phase vanishes at the classical point,\nbecause `h(1) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zD_continuousOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zD_continuousOn","kind":"theorem","line":265,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L265-L270","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zC_continuousOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zC_continuousOn","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L260-L263","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf_continuousOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf_continuousOn","kind":"theorem","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L248-L258","doc":"Continuity of `α_z` on `[1,b]` for a `z` continuous there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaD_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaD_ge","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L216-L246","doc":"**Convention D is unbounded above**: `α_D(s) ≥ s − 3` for `s ≥ 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaC_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaC_le","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L202-L214","doc":"**Convention C is unbounded below**: `α_C(s) ≤ −(s−1)/4` for `s ≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.alphaOf","kind":"def","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L199-L200","doc":"The asserted ladder eigenphase `α = (z − 1)·h/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.hS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.hS","kind":"def","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L196-L197","doc":"`h = q − q⁻¹` in `s = √q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zD","kind":"def","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L192-L194","doc":"Convention D Markov parameter in `s = √q` (canonical, owner ruling\n2026-08-15):  `z_D = q³/(q²+1) = s⁶/(s⁴+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.zC","kind":"def","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L189-L190","doc":"Convention C Markov parameter in `s = √q`:  `z_C = √q/(q+1) = s/(s²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_laurent_of_surjective_nonpos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_laurent_of_surjective_nonpos","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion.lean#L123-L183","doc":"**The core exclusion.**  If `α` attains every non-positive real on `[1,∞)`,\nthen `2 cos (α ·)` is not a Laurent polynomial `P(s)/s^N` there. ","signatureChunk":0}]}